---
const title = 'Privacy Policy | Orchestrix';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for Orchestrix." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="document-page">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Orchestrix home"><span aria-hidden="true">◈</span> Orchestrix</a>
      <article aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to sign up</a>
        <h1 id="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>
        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Orchestrix handles information when you use the service.</p>
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide, such as your email address and account details, along with content you choose to submit. We may also collect basic technical information about service use, such as device and log data, to operate and protect Orchestrix.</p>
        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <p>We use information to provide and maintain the service, manage accounts, respond to requests, protect against abuse, and improve Orchestrix. We do not use your information for purposes unrelated to the service without an appropriate basis.</p>
        <h2>Sharing</h2>
        <p>We may share information with service providers who help us operate Orchestrix, when required by law, or to protect the rights and safety of users and the service. We do not sell personal information.</p>
        <h2>Retention and security</h2>
        <p>We retain information for as long as needed for the purposes described here or as required by law. We use reasonable safeguards to protect information, though no method of storage or transmission is completely secure.</p>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can keep account information accurate and stop using the service at any time. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights to access, correct, or delete personal information; contact us to make a request.</p>
        <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
        <p>Orchestrix is not intended for children who are not permitted to use the service under applicable law. We do not knowingly collect personal information from such children.</p>
        <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
        <p>We may update this Policy as the service changes and will take reasonable steps to notify you of material updates. For privacy questions or requests, contact the Orchestrix team through the channel provided with the service.</p>
      </article>
      <footer><a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/login">Log in</a></footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { min-width: 320px; min-height: 100%; color-scheme: dark; background: #000; }
  :global(body) { min-width: 320px; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; color: #ededed; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0, #111 0, #050505 35rem, #000 75rem); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  .document-page { width: min(100% - 40px, 760px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 0 48px; }
  .wordmark { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 38px; color: #f5f5f5; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.35px; text-decoration: none; }
  .wordmark span { font-size: 21px; }
  article { padding: clamp(24px, 6vw, 48px); border: 1px solid #292929; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(8, 8, 8, .88); box-shadow: 0 20px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35); }
  .back-link, footer a { color: #aaa; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; }
  .back-link:hover, footer a:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; }
  h1 { margin: 28px 0 6px; font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -1.4px; }
  .updated { margin: 0 0 28px; color: #777; font-size: 12px; }
  article p { color: #bbb; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; }
  h2 { margin: 30px 0 8px; color: #f5f5f5; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
  h2 + p { margin-top: 0; }
  footer { padding: 20px 4px; text-align: center; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #3291ff; outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
